From: kirill <sleeply4cat@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 01:59:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 15/23] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6225-chuwi-aupad: add audio

The ADSP runs AudioReach, so replace sm6115's APR services with GPR.
Add the RX, TX and VA macros, both SoundWire masters and the static
audio PD heap, and on the board the WCD9370 and two AW87xxx amps.

Only the DCODEC resource vote works: the firmware fails the LPASS core
vote. HPH data stays on the second RX lane, and ADC1/2 use TX master
port 2 as on stock. Each amp drives two speakers: left is the top pair,
right the bottom pair.

Also drop a duplicated gpio-keys node and includes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015ya7egg5XM6dMvKwj1kAyq
---
